*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0043
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-05-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 179
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0043.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> YEARS WITH CURRENT EMPLOYER
    05 JOB-TENURE         PIC 9(2).
    *> GROSS ANNUAL INCOME
    05 ANN-INCOME         PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 MAX-PRINCIPAL      PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM INCOME-MULTIPLE
    DISPLAY "MAX-PRINCIPAL=" MAX-PRINCIPAL
    STOP RUN.
INCOME-MULTIPLE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> ESTABLISHED EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE - LIMIT 3.75 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN JOB-TENURE >= 5
            COMPUTE MAX-PRINCIPAL ROUNDED = ANN-INCOME * 4
        *> STANDARD EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE - LIMIT 1.5 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN JOB-TENURE >= 2
            COMPUTE MAX-PRINCIPAL ROUNDED = ANN-INCOME * 3
        WHEN OTHER
            COMPUTE MAX-PRINCIPAL ROUNDED = ANN-INCOME * 1.5
    END-EVALUATE.
